    <b>Robbery in the Library!</b><br>
    <font size=1><b>Date:</b> Sunday, March 25 @ 17:49:22 EST<br><b>Topic:</b> Guild Raids<br><br>
    </center><font size=2>
    Last night a group of young Heralds visited the local TOFS Public Library, and while there we spotted Mrs. Porkowitz, the hated 6th grade math teacher.  So we plotted a little scheme, and while Teshar distracted her by pretending to kill Noyr, Maleth ran up behind her and stole her bag.  He looted the Teacher's Syllabus and returned the bag.  So now we now the exam questions for every upcoming quiz in 6th grade math this semester!  Woot!
<br>
<br><br>
    <br><br>
    Teacher's Syllabus
MAGIC ITEM LORE ITEM 
+3 WIS, +3 INT, +20 MANA, +20 PR
WT: 0.5
Class: CLR, SHM, NEC, WIZ, MAG, ENC
Race: HUM, ERU, HIE, DEF, HEF, DWF, GNM, IKS
<br>
Rumor has it Underfoot may soon be in possession of this item.
<br>
As is typical of any Herald raid, we had a few deaths, including Aika, Enigmas, and a visiting reptile.  But great fun was had by all.   Thanks to Noyr, Teshar, Maleth, Enigmas, Czrak, Zerath, Everlast, Aika, and Meth for attending.<br>
Lyzandia<br><br>
